   - Accept `BrowserWindow` reference or event emitter
   - Emit progress events at key points:
     - When file processing starts
     - After each embedding batch
     - When file completes/fails
3. Update [src/preload/index.ts](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/src/preload/index.ts):
   - Add `onIndexingProgress(callback)` to API
4. Update [src/renderer/src/App.tsx](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/src/renderer/src/App.tsx):
   - Add state for indexing progress
   - Display progress indicator/toast notifications
   - Show real-time status in data table
5. Test with large files

