## Performance Optimizations

### 19. Implement Incremental Indexing

**Problem**: Re-indexing unchanged files wastes resources.

**Current State**: Scanner checks `modified_at` timestamp, which is good.

**Enhancement**: Add file checksums to detect content changes even if timestamp changes.

**Implementation Steps**:
1. Add checksum calculation to [src/main/ingestion/index.ts](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/src/main/ingestion/index.ts)
2. Store checksum in `files.checksum` column
3. Skip indexing if checksum matches
4. Test with file touch/move scenarios

**Files Modified**:
- [src/main/ingestion/index.ts](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/src/main/ingestion/index.ts)
- [src/main/scanner.ts](file:///Users/shaunakbhardwaj/Work/constellations/src/main/scanner.ts)

---

