## Implementation Order Recommendation

### Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-3)

**Week 1 - Critical Fixes**:
1. Fix type duplication (P0.1)
2. Fix search fileName bug (P0.2)
3. Add error boundaries (P0.3)

**Week 2 - Architecture**:
4. Refactor main process (P0.4)
5. Add configuration system (P1.9)
6. Add logging system (P2.14)

**Week 3 - Data Integrity**:
7. Add transaction safety (P1.7)
8. Fix LanceDB orphan cleanup (P1.8)
9. Implement schema migrations (P2.10)

---

### Phase 2: Model Management System (Weeks 4-6)

**Week 4 - Model Infrastructure**:
1. Create extensible model catalog (M1)
2. Build unified embedding provider interface (M2)
3. Implement multi-model vector storage schema (M3)

**Week 5 - API Integration**:
4. Build OpenRouter client (M4)
5. Implement secure API key management (M5)
6. Add local model download manager (M6)

**Week 6 - Model UI**:
7. Build model selection UI (M7)
8. Implement embeddings cleanup flow (M8)
9. Add LLM integration hooks (M9)

---

### Phase 3: Performance & Polish (Weeks 7-9)

**Week 7 - Performance**:
1. Parallelize scanner (P1.6)
2. Add indexing progress feedback (P1.5)
3. Add search debouncing (P2.12)

**Week 8 - UX Enhancements**:
4. Improve search results display (UX.16)
5. Add settings panel integration (UX.17)
6. Add file type icons (UX.18)

**Week 9 - Testing & Launch**:
7. Add unit tests (P2.15)
8. Fix GalaxyCanvas cleanup (P2.13)
9. Add health checks (Maint.21)
10. Final QA and polish

---

## Summary

| Phase | Duration | Focus |
|-------|----------|-------|
| Foundation | 3 weeks | Bug fixes, architecture, data integrity |
| Model Management | 3 weeks | Multi-model support, OpenRouter, API keys |
| Polish | 3 weeks | Performance, UX, testing |

**Total estimated time**: 9 weeks

---

## Notes

- Each item includes file paths to make implementation easier
- Breaking changes should be avoided where possible
- All changes should be backwards compatible with existing data
- Test thoroughly before deploying to production
- Consider creating feature flags for major changes
- Model Management is the biggest feature addition and should be well-tested before release
- OpenRouter API availability for embeddings should be verified early in Phase 2

